      "date": "2026-10-26 12:21:20.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good. The LWP LRU freeze matches the lru_resize_disable() mechanism, and the other server-side client namespaces (MGC config locks, MDT-MDT OSP locks) are LDLM_FL_NO_LRU, so LWP is the remaining LRU source of standalone cancels. One optional suggestion inline for a future refresh; no need to re-spin for it.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
